  "final_text": "I fixed the bug in `activity/timeparse.py`. The 12-hour time parser (`parse_12h`) treated \"12:xx AM\" as hour 12, which is noon, when it should be hour 0, midnight. So the events at 12:10 AM and 12:20 AM were placed at midday on March 2. That made it look like there was a long gap after 11:55 PM, and the midnight session got split in two.\n\nI added a branch so 12 AM converts to hour 0. All 7 tests now pass, including `test_session_across_midnight`. I didn't change any test files."
